  "description_text": "Simply put, 7 Basto Terrace is brand new from top to bottom. This Peters Hill single family was taken down to the studs and rebuilt with new systems, windows, roof and siding, while the original wood floors carry the home's character forward. You're welcomed through the enclosed front porch, now a finished mudroom for boots, bags, and everything else that comes through the door. Inside, the living room has a gracious bay window while the open kitchen and dining room keep weeknight dinners and weekend breakfasts easy. A first floor laundry room and powder room add modern convenience to perfectly complement the original charm. Upstairs you'll find three sunny bedrooms and an office. If you need more space, the finished attic awaits, with brand new plumbing lines at the ready. Even the basement offers room to expand in the future. The outdoor space is just as impressive as the interior with a large sunny backyard ringed by trees, made for summer cookouts and long dinners with friends. The exterior also boasts brand new front and back decks plus a freshly paved driveway with 4 off-street spaces, but the real standout feature of this house is the location. Fallon Field is a block away, 3 blocks to Roslindale Village and the commuter rail, plus the Arnold Arboretum is less than half a mile away. Come see 7 Basto, a fresh start with room to grow!",
