  "description_text": "Open House- Sat and Sunday 12-2pm.(21st and 22nd) Calling All Investors, Contractors & Builders! Rare opportunity to own a single-family home in desirable Roslindale, ideally situated alongside protected wetlands, scenic walking paths, and neighboring the beautiful Arnold Arboretum This 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath home offers tremendous potential for those looking to renovate, restore, and create something special in an exceptional natural setting. Could add a 3rd floor! The property requires a full interior renovation, including addressing significant damage from mold and burst pipes. The good news? A new roof and new heating system are already in place! Place has been completely cleaned out.. Bring your vision, creativity, and contractor to unlock the possibilities this property has to offer. Enjoy the unique combination of privacy, natural surroundings, and convenient Roslindale location, all while being close to beautiful outdoor spaces. A fantastic opportunity for investors, builders, or buyers looking for their next renovation project. Bring your ideas and make this property shine!",
